WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:02.760
- So your book is called
Very Fat, Very Brave.

00:00:02.760 --> 00:00:05.580
and I think I'm kind of aware
where the title comes from

00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:07.440
because I'm a fan of
yours, but for everybody

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:10.880
that doesn't know, why did
you, why did you title it that?

00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:14.172
- So when a fat woman
posts on the internet

00:00:14.172 --> 00:00:16.830
a picture of themselves in a bikini

00:00:16.830 --> 00:00:19.870
or something revealing, the internet goes,

00:00:19.870 --> 00:00:23.290
my God, you're so brave!

00:00:23.290 --> 00:00:27.050
Which is the fully
insane thing to be like,

00:00:27.050 --> 00:00:28.410
somebody who's wearing a bathing suit

00:00:28.410 --> 00:00:29.610
to go swimming is brave?

00:00:29.610 --> 00:00:31.710
No, they're just wearing
the correct articles

00:00:31.710 --> 00:00:33.210
of clothing to do an activity.

00:00:33.210 --> 00:00:34.990
- Well, and it's almost
insulting because--

00:00:34.990 --> 00:00:36.500
- Oh, it's fully insulting.

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:37.333
- I always loved that.

00:00:37.333 --> 00:00:38.990
And they're like, oh, you're so confident.

00:00:38.990 --> 00:00:39.860
You just don't care.

00:00:39.860 --> 00:00:41.347
And I'm like, what?

00:00:41.347 --> 00:00:42.251
(laughing)

00:00:42.251 --> 00:00:44.460
- That's just you don't
care because I'm like,

00:00:44.460 --> 00:00:46.790
I spent hours!

00:00:46.790 --> 00:00:48.640
- And like, I care about things.

00:00:48.640 --> 00:00:50.890
Maybe just know things
that you find important.

00:00:50.890 --> 00:00:54.060
But I was like, let's not
write me off like that.

00:00:54.060 --> 00:00:56.010
It's funny how they they're
like, Oh, you're so confident.

00:00:56.010 --> 00:00:57.070
I'm like, I'm not confident.

00:00:57.070 --> 00:00:58.370
I'm just like, being.

00:00:58.370 --> 00:00:59.590
- Yes, yes.

00:00:59.590 --> 00:01:01.970
It's so frustrating.

00:01:01.970 --> 00:01:03.540
So it's very tongue in cheek.

00:01:03.540 --> 00:01:05.720
I don't think I'm actually brave,

00:01:05.720 --> 00:01:07.797
but like, I would love to
meet somebody who was like--

00:01:07.797 --> 00:01:08.760
(grunting)

00:01:08.760 --> 00:01:10.950
She actually thinks she's
brave for being in a bikini?

00:01:10.950 --> 00:01:12.890
Like, I want to meet
that person to be like.

00:01:12.890 --> 00:01:16.020
- (laughing) I wanna have
coffee with that person.

00:01:16.020 --> 00:01:19.270
Well, in the book, you have
a way of dealing with haters

00:01:19.270 --> 00:01:21.330
and I want you to tell
everybody what that is.

00:01:21.330 --> 00:01:23.743
- Oh, I have so many different ways.

00:01:25.911 --> 00:01:27.888
- I have a particular
favorite, but you go ahead.

00:01:27.888 --> 00:01:30.140
- Wait, which one is your favorite?

00:01:30.140 --> 00:01:32.510
- I like whenever you say that,

00:01:32.510 --> 00:01:33.990
because this is my thing I always say,

00:01:33.990 --> 00:01:35.200
I think that's why I relate to it.

00:01:35.200 --> 00:01:39.500
I'm like, do you have that
much time to sit at home

00:01:39.500 --> 00:01:41.900
and like, rail on me right now?

00:01:41.900 --> 00:01:43.190
I don't even know you.

00:01:43.190 --> 00:01:44.617
You could've just ignored it.

00:01:44.617 --> 00:01:48.380
And like, I want your life,
if you have that kind of time.

00:01:48.380 --> 00:01:49.260
Like you turn around and go,

00:01:49.260 --> 00:01:50.670
I'm sorry your life is so little

00:01:50.670 --> 00:01:52.963
that you're worried about me over here.

00:01:54.279 --> 00:01:55.112
I love that.

00:01:55.112 --> 00:01:56.650
- I liked that one, too.

00:01:56.650 --> 00:02:00.460
Another one I have is if
someone calls you a cow,

00:02:00.460 --> 00:02:02.866
you just turn around and move with them.

00:02:02.866 --> 00:02:05.590
(laughing)

00:02:05.590 --> 00:02:06.840
- I love that!

